 elevated in labs)"], "alarm_features": ["Constitutional symptoms (weight loss, fatigue)", "Elevated WBC count"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.18032786885245902, "posterior": 0.10939226519337016, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": ["Constitutional symptoms and elevated LAP moderately challenge reactive leukocytosis as a benign cause."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.75, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.06375227686703096, "posterior": 0.13922651933701655, "danger": 0.75, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["The absence of active infection signs and constitutional symptoms moderately support lymphoid neoplasm over reactive leukocytosis."], "evidence_against": ["Absence of blasts weakens neoplastic causes but does not exclude chronic leukemias with normal differentials."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.55, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute lymphoblastic leukemia", "lymphoblastic lymphoma"]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.3005464480874317, "posterior": 0.3646408839779005, "danger": 0.65, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_